"66920859_84wVsKZCl", "review": {"abstract": "通过对比2008年黄金牛市开启之初与2016年初金价大幅反弹期间的马歇尔K值走势，我们发现M2相对于GDP在这两段时期中都出现了快速增长，应该说国际流动性的充裕是2016年上半年黄金上涨的重要推动力", "atUserVids": [], "bookId": "3300128305", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "chapterName": "13 康波体系下的黄金价格", "chapterUid": 18, "content": "黄金的上涨有两个原因，一个经济衰退，一个通货膨胀。通货膨胀时期的黄金未必值得持有，因为其他资产的收益可能更好。持有黄金最好的时机是经济衰退期，经济衰退有时也会伴随通货膨胀，也有时是通货紧缩。", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "htmlContent": "", "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "range": "13551-13650", "createTime": 1762677555, "title": "", "type": 1, "chapterIdx": 18, "reviewId": "66920859_84wVsKZCl", "userVid": 66920859, "topics": [], "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "13 康波体系下的黄金价格", "author": {"userVid": 66920859, "name": "大河奔流", "avatar": "https://wx.qlogo.cn/mmhead/Ib5852jAyb83YJgia42gDZWpgSJujHsyADgwcd65Rre6WNVEH63maBQ/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "vDesc": "一个人的判断能力受限于他的认知范围", "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "不要跟蠢货讲道理！", "medalInfo": {"id": "M14-0-100", "desc": "拯救书荒", "title": "好书导读人", "levelIndex": 100}}}, "likesCount": 15}, {"reviewId": "255567194_85dzKNJhj", "review": {"abstract": "通过对比2008年黄金牛市开启之初与2016年初金价大幅反弹期间的马歇尔K值走势，我们发现M2相对于GDP在这两段时期中都出现了快速增长，应该说国际流动性的充裕是2016年上半年黄金上涨的重要推动力", "atUserVids": [], "bookId": "3300128305", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "chapterName": "13 康波体系下的黄金价格", "chapterUid": 18, "content": "即将到来的2026年是不是就是经济衰退期+温和的通货膨胀？所以 黄金会📈？", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "htmlContent": "", "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "range": "13551-13650", "createTime": 1765100077, "title": "", "type": 1, "chapterIdx": 18, "reviewId": "255567194_85dzKNJhj", "userVid": 255567194, "topics": [], "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "13 康波体系下的黄金价格", "author": {"userVid": 255567194, "name": "咖啡豆", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0021-86nrSu9ZFS5TbWIKQUwhFf7/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "读万卷书，行万里路，然后成为更好的自己！", "medalInfo": {"id": "M9-0-10", "desc": "阅读神作", "title": "神作爱好者", "levelIndex": 10}}}, "likesCount": 1, "commentsCount": 2, "hotComments": []}]}, {"range": "13928-13933", "bookMarkCount": 0, "maxIdx": 0, "totalCount": 2, "hasMore": 0, "synckey": 1793261222, "pageReviews": [{"reviewId": "292501627_83gbwQWRz", "review": {"abstract": "马歇尔K值", "atUserVids": [], "bookId": "3300128305", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "chapterName": "13 康波体系下的黄金价格", "chapterUid": 18, "content": "马歇尔K值，又称货币化率，反映社会货币化程度。\n\n定义与计算\n- 马歇尔K值 = M2 / GDP，表示货币供应量与经济总量的比率\n- 用于衡量通过货币进行商品与服务交换的广度和深度\n\n经济意义\n- 反映货币供应与经济增长的匹配程度\n- K值过高可能表明货币过剩，存在经济过热或通胀风险\n- 与黄金价格呈现正相关关系，常作为流动性指标使用\n\n应用场景\n- 用于判断一国金融流动性状况\n- 被视为衡量超额流动性的关键指标\n- 在分析黄金价格波动时作为重要变量", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "htmlContent": "", "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "range": "13928-13933", "createTime": 1758205055, "title": "", "type": 1, "chapterIdx": 18, "reviewId": "292501627_83gbwQWRz", "userVid": 292501627, "topics": [], "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/7